  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Summoning and Servants in FGO</h2>\n<p>During the stream, the group discussed summoning mechanics in Fate/Grand Order (FGO). One participant mentioned receiving a servant named Ninomai Inanis, though it was unclear if this was a summon or a reference to Mary Antoinette. Another participant noted that a player typically receives one servant at the start of the game, though this may vary depending on the context or game mode.</p>\n<h2>Stream Interaction and Participation</h2>\n<p>The group was actively engaged in a stream, with members discussing whether they could participate in the chat and how it might affect the stream. One participant expressed a desire to join the chat but was mindful of not taking up too much time. Others reassured them that their participation would not be disruptive, and the group confirmed that their presence would not inconvenience others.</p>\n<p>There was also a discussion about being mindful of the stream&#x27;s duration and ensuring that the experience remained enjoyable for all participants. One member asked about the best summon to use and expressed a desire to share their results later.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_1Gmk7w-Eak</p>",
